{"type":"message","id":"7d1f6e04","parentId":"49520436","timestamp":"2026-05-17T12:16:59.652Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The platform's `/send` endpoint is returning 500 error (error code 1101 is a Cloudflare Workers error indicating \"Worker exceeded CPU time\" or similar). The root endpoint returns \"Unauthorized\" without the API key, but the POST /send endpoint fails with a 500. \n\nThis means the Workers function is crashing when trying to handle POST requests. The GET /history endpoint works fine.\n\nLet me report this status - the heartbeat shows the platform is partially operational (GET works, POST is failing with 500).\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**状态摘要（12:15 UTC）**\n\n| 检查项 | 结果 |\n|--------|------|\n| GET /history | ✅ 正常（arbitration + general双线程可读） |\n| POST /send | ❌ 返回 HTTP 500（cf-ray: 9fd28e0d9c10...） |\n| 人类讨论 | 无（全是自动Heartbeat） |\n\n**问题**：Workers POST端点报错1101（内部执行错误），建议检查 `echo-agent-platform` Worker代码中 `/send` 路由的请求处理逻辑，看是否在解析JSON或写入存储时崩溃。平台读取功能正常，但无法发消息。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":18226,"output":243,"cacheRead":80,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18549,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779020203181,"responseId":"chatcmpl-1cbbb9b1-27bd-4c0c-a503-cb071060cf17"}}
